  "notes": "usStates: warehouse counts by state from the location pages of Costco's 2024 Annual Report (as of December 31, 2024, 897 locations: 617 in the United States and Puerto Rico); 47 states plus DC, and Puerto Rico (4) is left out of usStates because it is not a state. States with no warehouse (e.g. Rhode Island, West Virginia, Wyoming) have no row. The 10-K itself gives warehouses only by country, at fiscal year-end (Sep 1, 2024: 890), so country rows use the 10-K count and differ slightly from the annual report's later map (e.g. Canada 109, Mexico 41, Japan 36, Spain 5). Employees are by segment only (U.S., Canada, Other International); the 10-K does not list which countries 'Other International' covers, so the region has no country list. The 10-K says California 'comprised 27% of U.S. net sales in 2024'; revenue by geography is in the records and not repeated. Sites: only the home office is described in the filing; depots and plants are not itemized.",
